/ Layout for ViewComponent previews (Lookbook).
/
/ Deliberately not the application layout: that one renders layouts/_header,
/ which reads current_user.avatar, and a preview has nobody signed in. This
/ pulls in the same head — so Vite assets, Tailwind and the theme all apply —
/ and nothing else.
doctype html
html[lang="en"]
  head
    = render 'layouts/head'
  body.p-8 data-controller="icons theme"
    = yield
